# 固化行尾策略（2026-11-01 追加，依据 reports/2026-11-01-项目现状核查与优化建议.md §2.1）
# 原则：入库一律 LF 归一（与全局 core.autocrlf=true 行为一致，零噪声）；
#       Windows 脚本强制工作区 CRLF；二进制显式排除，防止被 text=auto 误判。
* text=auto
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ppk binary
